; Spell descriptions (sheet Spells/Effects tabs; <nameKey>.desc, {} = base power).
spell.flame.desc=A puff of flame in the hand. It lights an unlit torch held in the other hand, or the wall torch ahead; a cold brazier needs more than a flicker.
spell.rock.desc=A small stone in the hand, good for a throw. With both hands full it drops at your feet.
spell.gust.desc=A breeze from the hand. It fans a fire ahead into a brief flare; strong enough, it pushes back what stands ahead and turns shots aside.
spell.splash.desc=A handful of water. It fills a container held in the other hand a little, or puts out the wall torch ahead; a brazier takes a stronger splash.
spell.firebolt.desc=A bolt of flame at a single foe - {} damage, and it catches.
spell.earthbolt.desc=The magic missile: a hard, fast bolt of stone at a single foe - {} damage.
spell.waterbolt.desc=A jet of water thrown hard at a single foe - {} damage.
spell.airbolt.desc=A gust that shoves the struck foe back a step.
spell.firebolt_volley.desc=Several weaker bolts down the caster's lane, one after another; more as the caster grows.
spell.firebolt_burst.desc=A ball of flame that bursts where it strikes, filling the squares around - the party's too, if it is close.
spell.earthbolt_volley.desc=Several weaker bolts down the caster's lane, one after another; more as the caster grows.
spell.earthbolt_burst.desc=The bolt bursts where it strikes, filling the squares around - the party's too, if it is close.
spell.waterbolt_volley.desc=Several weaker bolts down the caster's lane, one after another; more as the caster grows.
spell.waterbolt_burst.desc=The bolt bursts where it strikes, filling the squares around - the party's too, if it is close.
spell.airbolt_volley.desc=Several weaker bolts down the caster's lane, one after another; more as the caster grows.
spell.airbolt_burst.desc=The bolt bursts where it strikes, filling the squares around - the party's too, if it is close.
spell.stoneskin_party.desc=The ward settles over every standing member of the party, a little weaker on each.
spell.stoneskin_burst.desc=The ward's power bursts outward from the caster, sparing the square they stand in. No ward is left.
spell.fireshield_party.desc=The ward settles over every standing member of the party, a little weaker on each.
spell.fireshield_burst.desc=The ward's power bursts outward from the caster, sparing the square they stand in. No ward is left.
spell.waterveil_party.desc=The ward settles over every standing member of the party, a little weaker on each.
spell.waterveil_burst.desc=The ward's power bursts outward from the caster, sparing the square they stand in. No ward is left.
spell.windward_party.desc=The ward settles over every standing member of the party, a little weaker on each.
spell.windward_burst.desc=The ward's power bursts outward from the caster, sparing the square they stand in. No ward is left.
spell.stoneskin.desc=Skin like stone — soaks {} damage from every blow.
spell.fireshield.desc=Wreathed in flame — a landed blow scorches the attacker for {}.
spell.waterveil.desc=A flowing veil soaks the next {} damage, then bursts.
spell.windward.desc=The wind turns aside the next {} bolts.
spell.embersight.desc=See the living heat glow through the wall ahead.
spell.farsight.desc=Sight carries down the passage, wall after wall.
spell.stonesight.desc=Read the stone ahead — and remember what lies there.
spell.scrying.desc=Reveal what lies hidden in the wall ahead.
